  "objectives": [
    {
      "text": "Kinwood, The Celebration of Life Co. creates short films to celebrate lives.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kinwood's films are often played at Celebration of Life events.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The client family provides photos, cell phone video, and 4-8 names for a Kinwood interview.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The funding for the 'Fixing the Funeral' project was canceled by the project creator on June 20, 2025.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The funding period for the 'Fixing the Funeral' project was from May 22, 2025, to July 4, 2025.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Some families that are separated by great distances choose to make a Kinwood film instead of a funeral.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kinwood produces a 20–30-minute commemorative film using interview footage, photos, home movies, and cell phone video.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "product",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kinwood films are often played at a Celebration of Life.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Some families choose to make a Kinwood film instead of a funeral.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kinwood understands that families and friends want to honor a life.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A Kinwood Commemorative Film becomes an instant heirloom and a centerpiece for any Celebration of Life.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "product",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The cremation rate in the USA is 60% today, compared to 5% in the 1960s.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Many families now prefer to take the urn and do their own thing after cremation, often at locations like clubs, parks, or restaurants.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kinwood films cater to families who are questioning the traditional funeral business.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "25% of funeral homes are now owned and controlled by private equity and conglomerates.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kinwood Films produces films for families questioning the traditional funeral business.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Families are leaving the funeral category because they believe big-funeral companies prioritize upselling unwanted services.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kinwood Films aims to lead the change for more meaningful commemorations in the funeral industry.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kinwood Commemorative Films can be watched on big screens or phones, preserving stories and feelings of connection.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "innovation",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "product",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Many Kinwood films are re-watched dozens of times and serve as a way to relive memories.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "innovation",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "product",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The founding question for Kinwood Films was whether traditional funeral services are the best option available.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The Jody Project was inspired by the founder's experiences attending funerals and questioning the quality of memorial services.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The founder's friend, Jody, was diagnosed with pancreatic cancer and died six weeks later, which motivated the creation of The Jody Project.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "For Jody's celebration of life, a friend named Jesse conducted interviews with attendees, capturing their memories and reflections.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The interviews for Jody's celebration of life were filmed over three hours.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The team created a pilot film using photo albums and videos sent by Jody's friends.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The Jody Project received its first job through an obituary cold call.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kinwood's original business idea was to apply the skills of professional creatives to the funeral industry.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 4,
        "char_start": 5600,
        "char_end": 7400
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kinwood has completed several cloud films that are beloved by families.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 4,
        "char_start": 5600,
        "char_end": 7400
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kinwood needs to build a digital platform to bring cloud films to bereaved families.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 4,
        "char_start": 5600,
        "char_end": 7400
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kinwood's films serve as an important heirloom for families.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 4,
        "char_start": 5600,
        "char_end": 7400
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kinwood received its first job through an obituary cold call.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 4,
        "char_start": 5600,
        "char_end": 7400
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kinwood worked with several funeral homes that referred clients to them.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 4,
        "char_start": 5600,
        "char_end": 7400
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kinwood aims to create a Kinwood Commemorative Film that allows families to learn, share, and collaborate.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 5,
        "char_start": 7000,
        "char_end": 8800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The new digital platform will enable families to upload content and invite friends to interviews.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 5,
        "char_start": 7000,
        "char_end": 8800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kinwood's campaign aims to allow anyone, anywhere, to collaborate with friends and family to create an heirloom.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 5,
        "char_start": 7000,
        "char_end": 8800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kinwood's philosophy is encapsulated in the tagline 'Leave memories, not condolences.'",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 5,
        "char_start": 7000,
        "char_end": 8800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kinwood's mission is to produce authentic products for families to celebrate lives.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 5,
        "char_start": 7000,
        "char_end": 8800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kinwood is committed to developing the best possible experience for bereaved families.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 6,
        "char_start": 8400,
        "char_end": 10200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kinwood pledges to keep its backer community updated on progress and be transparent about challenges.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "risk",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 6,
        "char_start": 8400,
        "char_end": 10200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kinwood is replacing caskets with commemorative films.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "innovation",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "product",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 6,
        "char_start": 8400,
        "char_end": 10200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kinwood films are designed to last forever and do not involve burial.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "innovation",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "product",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 6,
        "char_start": 8400,
        "char_end": 10200
      }
    }
