      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Funeral companies sell caskets, cemetery plots, headstones, and markers to support a burial.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt98__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Families who choose cremation have few options on how to commemorate a life.",
